 .../kotlin/app/aaps/compose/navigation/AppRoute.kt     |  1 +
 .../aaps/ui/compose/quickLaunch/QuickLaunchAction.kt   |  3 ++-
 4 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

